"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Imida yesantya, uxhulumaniso ngalunye lwe torrent, ukufaka izithuba kunye nokufaka izityalo zimiselwe kwi-torrent nganye xa uyidibanisa, okanye kamva phantsi kweMimiselo ye-Torrent. Ii-torrents zisebenzisa umntu onegunya lokusebenzela omnye umntu ukusuka kwi-Connection tab (HTTP okanye SOCKS5, okanye umntu onegunya lokusebenzela omnye umntu we Mac nge \"Sebenzisa izicwangciso zenkqubo\") kunye nemida yesantya kuzo zonke izilayishi. Iinguqu ziya kusebenza kwii-torrents eziqaliswe emva koko. Abalingani kunye nabalandeleli bangabona idilesi yakho ye-IP, okanye yomntu onegunya lokusebenzela omnye umntu.";
"Settings used for every download from a website. A site also covers its subdomains (example.com covers www.example.com). Logins are only sent to that site and are kept with the app's other secrets." = "Imimiselo esetyenziselwa kukhuphelo ngalunye oluvela kwiwebhusayithi. Iwebhusayithi igubungela iimimandla zayo ezisezantsi (umzekelo.com igubungela www.umzekelo.com). Igama elithile lithunyelwe kuphela kuloo ndawo kwaye ligcinwa kunye nezinye iimfihlakalo zenkqubo.";
"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "Ugcino bucala lugcina izicwangciso zakho, izicwangciso zenxuwa, ufolo kunye noluhlu lokukhuphela ezantsi. Igama lokugqitha kunye neecookies azifakwanga kukhuseleko.";
"When you copy a link that ends in one of these types, the Add window opens with it." = "Xa ukopa ikhonkco eliphelela kwinye yazo zonke iintlobo, i Yongeza i window ivula nayo.";
"Expected checksums are checked automatically when a download finishes. Queues can also quit the app, sleep or shut down the Mac when they are done (Scheduler)." = "Ii-checksums ezilindelekileyo zivavanywa ngokuzenzekelayo xa kukhupho lugqityiwe. Iifolokhwe zinokuphuma kwinkqubo, ziphumle okanye zivale i-Mac xa zigqityiwe (Umcwangcisi).";
"Save the extension folder, open the browser's extensions page, switch on Developer mode, choose Load unpacked and pick the folder." = "Gcina isiqulathi seefayili sesiqhoboshelo, vula iphepha lesiqhoboshelo somkhangeli zincwadi, tshintshela kwimo yophuhlisi, khetha Faka ngaphandle koxinzelelo uze ukhethe isiqulathi seefayili.";
"Save the add-on file and drag it onto a Firefox window. Firefox installs add-ons that are signed; see the README for signing your copy." = "Gcina ifayili yokongeza uze uyirhoxise kwifestile ye-Firefox. I-Firefox ifaka ukongeza okutyikityiweyo; bona i README yotyikitya ikopi yakho.";
"Install the ndm command, then for example: ndm https://example.com/file.zip --queue Night" = "Faka umyalelo we-ndm, ngoko umzekelo: ndm https://example.com/file.zip --queue Night";
"Finding the qualities on offer…" = "Ukufumana iimpawu ezinikezelwa…";
"Video sites are saved in the best quality available, with picture and sound joined." = "Iindawo zevidiyo zigcinwa kumgangatho olungileyo ofumanekayo, ngomfanekiso nesandi esidityanisiweyo.";
"Put a range in square brackets: [001-100] keeps three digits, [1-100] does not, [a-z] uses letters and [0-100:5] counts in fives. Several ranges multiply." = "Faka umqolo kwizibiyeli ezithe nkqo: [001-100] igcina amanani amathathu, [1-100] ayisebenzi, [a-z] isebenzisa iileta kwaye [0-100:5] ibala kwisihlanu. Imiqolo emininzi iphindaphindwa.";
